SUMMARY:Chesapeake and Ohio 2 Day Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for two days point to point hiking on the Chesapeake and Ohio Cana
 l and more!\nSunday we'll do between Brunswick and Monocacy Aqueduct\, and
  Monday we'll head downstream from Monocacy Aqueduct.\nAfter meeting Sunda
 y at 9 at the aqueduct\, we will shuttle with as few vehicles as possible 
 to the Holiday Inn.\nWe start right from the hotel\, and follow the Valley
  Trail system downhill through a pleasant gully to downtown Brunswick.\nHe
 re\, we'll cross the tracks and make our way onto the canal towpath to fol
 low it to Monocacy Creek.\nThe first day will feature lovely riverside sce
 nery\, historic canal locks\, and two major aqueducts. We'll take side tri
 ps to the river along the way.\nWe'll stay at the Holiday Inn\, then the s
 econd day\, we'll shuffle cars and hike between Monocacy Aqueduct and Syca
 more Landing.\nBoth places have little lunch stops along them if needed\, 
 but everyone should come prepared with plenty of water and food just in ca
 se.\nWith the exception of under a mile through scenic downtown Brunswick\
 , there is no road walking.\nThe first day has only 5 road access points\,
  and the second has only 4\, and not all of these are crossings.\nThis pro
 mises to be a beautiful\, relaxing two days along the canal and Potomac Ri
 ver.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 8374
